sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Platform
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant CNPG as CNPG
    participant BK as Backup bucket
    participant SQ as SonarQube

    OP->>GH: PR new image_digest
    GH->>GH: preview + G0–G3
    OP->>CNPG: On-demand backup
    CNPG->>BK: base backup
    CNPG-->>OP: Backup completed
    OP->>GH: merge
    GH->>SQ: helm_release app (atomic)
    SQ->>SQ: startup · DB migration
    alt migration and startup succeed
        SQ-->>GH: ready · status UP
    else fails before migrating
        GH->>SQ: atomic rolls back to the previous image
    else fails after migrating
        Note over SQ: no image rollback (DG §6)
        OP->>CNPG: new Cluster from the backup
        OP->>GH: PR with the previous digest
    end
